## Shared worktree

Your worktree /work/export, on branch agent/export-1a2b, is shared with these other sessions:

- go-developer (mode implement, access write, running)
- reviewer (mode review, access read-only, ended)

The harness does not lock files. Coordinate through commits: commit small and often, never reset, rebase or rewrite the shared branch, expect files to change under you, and pull in nothing.